{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552220/extras/9eaf11ce5e83191e2d7d6145f6083fdb.poster.avif?t=1758733806\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552220/extras/9eaf11ce5e83191e2d7d6145f6083fdb.webm?t=1758733806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552220/extras/9eaf11ce5e83191e2d7d6145f6083fdb.mp4?t=1758733806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match Shot Chimera is a match-3 shoot 'em up with roguelite elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match-3 to deal big damage and collect XP for leveling up your chimera's abilities, all while dodging a wild array of enemies and bullets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock persistent upgrades and unlock new characters to try different play-styles and get further on your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552220/extras/10e6a2446fb5b8b05ca9e5348089e8ed.webp?t=1758733806\" width=615 height=51 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552220/extras/c2ca61f55cc7d0e565969761d7336daa.webp?t=1758733806\" width=615 height=58 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552220/extras/ce7e58d2cd30ac8ee8f41d43af665456.poster.avif?t=1758733806\" width=614 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552220/extras/ce7e58d2cd30ac8ee8f41d43af665456.webm?t=1758733806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552220/extras/ce7e58d2cd30ac8ee8f41d43af665456.mp4?t=1758733806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical shoot 'em up gameplay</strong> - Dodge through a bullet hell while powering up your weapons to bring down massive and bizarre match-block filled bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Match-3 to make enemies go boom </strong>- <i> </i>Enemies drop colored puzzle blocks. Match-3 to blow things up and get XP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Upgrades</strong> - From exploding shot, new bullet patterns, and healing puzzle matches to shooting fatter, slower bullets, there are plenty of different upgrades to make your chimera's next build unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different weapons for every block color</strong> - Hold different blocks to shoot beam weapons, exploding bomb shot, homing missiles, and more. Switch at will to change weapons, match colors, and use your powers.Varied</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple characters - </strong>Choose from multiple chimeras with different powers, stats and weapons. Focus-fire, drop shields, launch drones, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Levels - </strong>Varied levels are generated from hand-crafted blocks full of hand-tested randomizations. Each level has a different style, and is populated with a different pool of enemies, mini-bosses and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play again and again</strong> - Tough shoot 'em up gameplay and bullet dodging will demand skill and quick thinking.\u00a0 But dying is just the beginning of another run where you can try again with different builds and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Upgrades </strong> - Collect ichor during runs and save up to upgrade your abilities, unlock new characters and change the structure of the levels themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller support</strong> - Fluid controls support just about any joypad you can plug in, or keyboards! Mice, too, if you're into that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong> - A sweet suite of squelchy crunching beats, custom-made to blast to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552220/extras/10e6a2446fb5b8b05ca9e5348089e8ed.webp?t=1758733806\" width=615 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552220/extras/4a317b3423fcfcf2eb2d64e08c06fb69.webp?t=1758733806\" width=615 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552220/extras/f060512923e3b293d8e91b26ec430ba2.poster.avif?t=1758733806\" width=612 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552220/extras/f060512923e3b293d8e91b26ec430ba2.webm?t=1758733806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552220/extras/f060512923e3b293d8e91b26ec430ba2.mp4?t=1758733806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien Mechanovirus Typhon has invaded the Earth. Biochimera Jeremy is our final hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I also make web comics, so the story looks like this sometimes! It has a bit of heart, a chunk of goofs, and a scoop of eldritch mechanical horror making crude copies of the world it's devouring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552220?t=1758733806","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552220/5eefa8efa39cb53bf86bc188f0f664ae71897f20/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758733806","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552220/ec109ac3c81b8751b4cd88eb9e4459d743afdf89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758733806","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552220/ec109ac3c81b8751b4cd88eb9e4459d743afdf89/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758733806","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552220/extras/9eaf11ce5e83191e2d7d6145f6083fdb.poster.avif?t=1758733806\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552220/extras/9eaf11ce5e83191e2d7d6145f6083fdb.webm?t=1758733806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552220/extras/9eaf11ce5e83191e2d7d6145f6083fdb.mp4?t=1758733806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match Shot Chimera is a match-3 shoot 'em up with roguelite elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>